{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51965","headline":"大圆山（大圆山有光尘子墨迹云云。傍书宋乾道壬辰年，相传以爲吕仙作矣。） · 吕岩","name":"大圆山（大圆山有光尘子墨迹云云。傍书宋乾道壬辰年，相传以爲吕仙作矣。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三山相接欲飞腾，高下来爲半日登。\n合向中间着夫子，大员道士小员僧。\n（《蜀中名胜记》十八《重庆府·定远县》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}